  "peptideContentTesofensineDescription": "La tesofensina es un inhibidor oral de la recaptación de monoaminas investigado para la obesidad y enfermedades neurodegenerativas. No es un péptido, pero se menciona con frecuencia en comunidades de control de peso junto a compuestos GLP-1.",
  "@peptideContentTesofensineDescription": {
    "description": "Educational reference description for Tesofensine.",
    "sourceString": "Tesofensine is an oral monoamine reuptake inhibitor investigated for obesity and neurodegenerative conditions. It is not a peptide, but it is frequently discussed in weight-management communities near GLP-1 compounds.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for Tesofensine."
  },
  "peptideContentTesofensineTypicalDose": "0.25–0.5 mg al día en estudios",
