    "description": "Educational reference description for Testosterone.",
    "sourceString": "Testosterone is an endogenous androgen hormone. Injectable ester preparations (such as cypionate and enanthate) are prescription medications used in clinician-supervised hormone therapy. This entry is a neutral tracking reference for user-entered schedules.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for Testosterone."
  },
